{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":2,"title":"최댓값의 위치","desc":"<p>벡터에서 <b>최댓값이 처음 나타나는 위치</b>(1부터 센 번호)를 돌려주는 <code>which_max_pos(x)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","solution":"which_max_pos <- function(x) {\n  which.max(x)\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>which.max()</code>는 최댓값의 위치를 알려줘요. (가장 처음 위치)</p>","tests":[{"call":"which_max_pos(c(1, 3, 2))","expected":2,"visible":true},{"call":"which_max_pos(c(5, 5))","expected":1,"visible":true},{"call":"which_max_pos(-1)","expected":1,"visible":false},{"call":"which_max_pos(c(2, 9, 9, 1))","expected":2,"visible":false}],"starter":"which_max_pos <- function(x) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-324"}